## Project Description
This program monitors simulated device temperature readings for a Computer Engineering laboratory[span_2](start_span)[span_2](end_span). It stores sensor data, validates inputs, classifies each reading as NORMAL, WARNING, or CRITICAL, and generates a detailed numerical summary with an overall status indicator[span_3](start_span)[span_3](end_span).
 
## Features
- View all stored temperature readings with index positions[span_4](start_span)[span_4](end_span)
- Add a new valid reading (whole numbers from 0 to 100 only)[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span)
- Classify every reading based on strict boundary parameters[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span)
- Generate numerical summaries, category percentages, and status reports[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span)
- Robust input validation rejecting wrong menu inputs and invalid numeric ranges[span_8](start_span)[span_8](end_span)
 
